      "content": "2.2 Rivers of Goa"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "51ifhsi",
      "content": "Goa has a network of about 11 rivers, all of which flow westward into the Arabian Sea. The rivers are critical for agriculture, drinking water, and navigation."
