      "level": 2,
      "content": "2.6 Climate of Goa"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6jvxj9n",
      "content": "Goa has a tropical monsoon climate. It receives heavy rainfall from the southwest monsoon between June and September. The climate can be broadly divided into three seasons:"
    },
    {
      "id": "wtf0b82",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Season</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Months</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Characteristics</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Summer</p>",
            "<p>March to May</p>",
            "<p>Hot and humid; temperatures 32°C–40°C; high humidity</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Monsoon</p>",
            "<p>June to September</p>",
            "<p>Heavy rainfall; average 2500–3000 mm; SW monsoon</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Winter</p>",
            "<p>October to February</p>",
            "<p>Cool and pleasant; temperatures 20°C–32°C; peak tourist season</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
